{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52164","headline":"诫杀生文 · 李元礼","name":"诫杀生文","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"麟甲羽毛诸□类，秉性与我元无二。\n只爲前生作用愚，致使今生头角异。\n或水中游，或林里戏，争忍伤残供品味。\n磨刀着火欲烹时，口不能言眼还视。\n我闻天地之大德曰生，莫把羣生当容易。\n残双贼命伤太和，□子劝妻夸便利。\n只知合眼恣无明，不悟幽冥毫发记。\n命将终，冤对至，面覩阴官争许讳。\n人□爲兽兽爲人，物里轮回深可畏。\n不杀名爲大放生，免落阿毗无间地。\n（《八琼室金石补正》卷一一一。\n爲北宋政间和登封石刻。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李元礼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52164.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52164","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}